  "notes": "Adds qualified runtime current checks for heater and cooler, coherent battery/charge compensation, component-scoped latched faults and recovery, and current-based output gates. Incomplete or mixed evidence stays inconclusive. Flashlight Auto consumes only qualified direct environment ranges, excluding near bowl/alias echoes and preserving Smoke target continuity. Rejected or stale samples switch Auto off through the existing fade. IR profile setup retains earlier 18/14 PCLK and 60 ms settings, confirms register readbacks, and rejects any nested driver I/O error masked by a later successful transaction. IR ambient remains a proxy, not visible lux; no sensor distance recalibration is claimed. New hardware acceptance is pending. Old SW6106 hardware diagnostics remain paused.",
